      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我对面露好奇表情的美浦波旁说明，\n这样的感受就是代表着“开心”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdf5021fd3e8e512777a366d42f0f398a2e6fb3131a37ad8f187b2ee4edb90cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
