    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acad980dff310ef36846cb6b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──我只要接触机器，就会有很高几率造成破坏。\n观察店内后，针对机台大小发动风险管理评估。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b8bdb922cb00ce0d1963722026a2d1d770f7ad05c74c6a44df9d416381001d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
