    {
      "uid": "zhcn:963b8b5b661da3714dad421d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而耗费两个人力去取得玩偶，这种生产效率极低的行为，\n为何会产生“开心”的感受呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "40c7307d7e651ad9c23e00c8c6ed63250f743a8782252b2e15b6fb8b1ef4c21d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
